  <h1 class="page-title">Claude Haiku 5.5 Pricing Deep Dive: The 5× Cliff at 100k Tokens</h1>
  <p class="updated">Pricing Analysis · 21 October 2026</p>
  <p class="byline">By the LLM CFO team</p>

